<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Leonius: Throne of the Stars | Kickstarter & NFT Drop</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0b0c10;
            --text-color: #c5c6c7;
            --accent-primary: #66fcf1;
            --accent-secondary: #45a29e;
            --card-bg: #1f2833;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: var(--bg-color); color: var(--text-color); line-height: 1.6; }
        header { text-align: center; padding: 4rem 1rem; background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #1f2833, #0b0c10); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-secondary); }
        h1 { color: #fff; font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; }
        h2 { color: var(--accent-primary); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-weight: 300; }
        .countdown { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 2rem; background: var(--card-bg); display: inline-block; padding: 1rem 2rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--accent-primary); }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 1rem 2rem; background-color: var(--accent-primary); color: #000; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; transition: transform 0.2s, background-color 0.2s; margin: 0.5rem; }
        .btn:hover { background-color: #fff; transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .btn-outline { background-color: transparent; border: 2px solid var(--accent-primary); color: var(--accent-primary); }
        .btn-outline:hover { background-color: var(--accent-primary); color: #000; }
        section { padding: 4rem 1rem; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
        .card { background-color: var(--card-bg); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-primary); }
        .card h3 { color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .tier-price { font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--accent-primary); font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 1rem; display: block; }
        .waitlist-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; max-width: 500px; margin: 2rem auto 0; }
        input[type="email"] { padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--accent-secondary); background: var(--bg-color); color: #fff; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 1rem; }
        footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid #333; margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>HELP US EXPAND THE LEONIS UNIVERSE</h1>
    <h2>Leonius: Throne of the Stars</h2>
    <div class="countdown">Launching on Kickstarter: October 21, 2026</div>
    <div>
        <a href="#" class="btn">Notify Me on Kickstarter</a>
        <a href="#nft" class="btn btn-outline">Join the Solana Waitlist</a>
    </div>
</header>

<section id="synopsis">
    <h2 style="color: #fff; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #333; padding-bottom: 1rem;">The Cosmic Trilogy</h2>
    <p style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 1rem auto;">Written by Darnell McCullough, this epic space-opera science-fantasy connects worlds across the Leo Constellation.</p>
    <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Book 1: Zyphoria</h3>
            <p>Rise of Galaxius. A ~32-page, full-color introduction to a universe shaped by wonder and conflict.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Book 2: Noctureon</h3>
            <p>Glow of Darkness. A ~32-page, full-color venture into the darkness beyond.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Book 3: Trine</h3>
            <p>Oceans of Destiny. The 70-page, perfect-bound climax to the opening saga.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="tiers" style="background-color: var(--card-bg); max-width: 100%; padding-left: 2rem; padding-right: 2rem;">
    <div style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <h2 style="color: #fff; text-align: center;">Kickstarter Reward Tiers</h2>
        <p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Help us reach our $15,000 USD funding goal.</p>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card" style="background-color: var(--bg-color);">
                <h3>Digital Bundle</h3>
                <span class="tier-price">$12</span>
                <p>The complete trilogy formatted for your favorite digital reader.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card" style="background-color: var(--bg-color);">
                <h3>Trilogy Print Set</h3>
                <span class="tier-price">$32</span>
                <p>The hero tier: all three physical books plus their digital counterparts.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card" style="background-color: var(--bg-color);">
                <h3>Producer Tier</h3>
                <span class="tier-price">$175</span>
                <p>Collector's Edition items, signed extras, and an official credit in Book 4.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="nft" style="text-align: center;">
    <h2 style="color: #fff;">The Next Frontier: Leonis on Solana</h2>
    <p style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">Claim your place in the constellation. Join the waitlist for our exclusive digital collectible drop to unlock hidden lore and backer-only access perks.</p>
    <form class="waitlist-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Waitlist joined!');">
        <input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required>
        <button type="submit" class="btn">Secure Waitlist Spot</button>
    </form>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Leonis Comics / Grow Forward Publishing. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html> 
